diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 7b658bc..39b1ed0 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -77,3 +77,5 @@ The examples are the output standard. Do not modernize, simplify, or redesign th
 
 The `feat/standard-edition` branch builds a separate Windows x64 portable app, `RefracDraft-Standard.exe`. Its parameter area is a spreadsheet-style table with one module per row: length, expansion length, thickness, optional taper (big/small head plus Ê≠£Êï≤/‰æßÊï≤), and optional anchor settings. Anchor fields appear only after the anchor checkbox is enabled, and diamond embedment depth appears only for diamond anchors. Cells use short model labels, centered alignment, direct entry, Excel/WPS paste, a fill handle, double-click whole-column editing, and Ctrl+Z/Ctrl+Y history. The output panel remembers the working directory, supports an external PDF font directory, and defaults filenames to `Ê®°ÂùóÂä†Â∑•Âõæ_ÊúàÊó•_`. Board-face size is derived from length √ó thickness. Existing irregular inputs are rejected with a module-specific error instead of being silently replaced. The full edition remains on `feat/phase-1-core-engine`. See [Windows Standard guide](docs/WINDOWS_STANDARD.md).
 
+A six-module Excel sample is available at `examples/standard_example_6_modules.xlsx`.
+
